<title>GREECE: GREEK TELECOM OTE GDS QUOTED ON SEAQ INTL.</title>
<headline>GREEK TELECOM OTE GDS QUOTED ON SEAQ INTL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quotation of Global Depository Receipts / Shares (GDR / GDS) of Greek telecom OTE starts June 18 in London's SEAQ international market.</p>
<p>The Reuters Instrument Code (RIC) is OTEq.L. </p>
<p>Prices will be quoted in $. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
